    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1311">

                <pb facs="0889" n="773" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg773"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/67.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consular Agent Lewis to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Los Mochis</hi>
                        </placeName> (<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1914-03-05T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1914-03-04T00:00:00-04:30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date><hi rendition="#italic">; received March 5,
                            1914</hi>).</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>You message 27th. Unable secure confirmation of statement regarding demand by
                    Carranza. If such was made interested parties evidently not desirous of having
                    matter known.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lewis</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
